# Animate Dead may enchant a creature card in a graveyard that has protection from black: protection is a permanent's
# static ability and functions only on the battlefield (CR 113.6, 702.16c), so the Aura enters attached to the White
# Knight card and returns it. On the battlefield the Knight's protection from black means the Aura can't be attached to it
# (CR 702.16c); the state-based actions put the Aura into the graveyard (CR 303.4c, 704.5m), and its leaves-the-battlefield
# ability sacrifices the Knight. Bot1 discards the Knight to hand size on turn 3 and casts Animate Dead on it on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
White Knight
Black Lotus
Animate Dead
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Cleanup]
Bot1.Discard(White Knight)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.White Knight)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
LeftBattlefield = Black Lotus (tapped); Animate Dead; White Knight
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = White Knight; Animate Dead; Black Lotus
